@KD0571 @lauferlaw I do get it.  And #MeToo is hugely important.

I can hold both thoughts in mind: important to take allegations seriously and also important to value someone's right to defend themselves.

(And IMO that should be a no-brainer, but apparently not.)

@SolomonAtlee I read every word that he put out VERY carefully and I knew the same.

He did not want to disrespect women, he understood the importance of #MeToo and calling women liars would have been BAD look.

But he was disputing.  And he kept disputing as things progressed.  But not heard.
